{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_normal_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_normal_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "D1F1D51ED872AF88",
      "text": "你和我已经在四天王战……\\n也就是技能测验时交过手了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_02",
      "hash64": "D1F1D81ED872B4A1",
      "text": "所以你应该\\n不会有任何感慨。\\r\\n不过还是请多指教了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_03",
      "hash64": "D1F1D71ED872B2EE",
      "text": "这次我的身份是道馆馆主，\\n所以我会派平时的宝可梦和你对战的。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "D1F1DA1ED872B807",
      "text": "一般属性……\\n普通……常见……\\r\\n平凡……不稀奇……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "D1F1D91ED872B654",
      "text": "和没有个性的我很搭调，\\n我就喜欢这样。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_06",
      "hash64": "D1F1DC1ED872BB6D",
      "text": "人和宝可梦都应该\\n更简单易懂才好。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_07",
      "hash64": "D1F1DB1ED872B9BA",
      "text": "这个世界总是对古怪啊，奇葩啊，\\n还有不走寻常路的另眼相看。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_08",
      "hash64": "D1F1CE1ED872A3A3",
      "text": "去别的地方旅游或许很愉快，\\n但回家后不才是最舒坦的吗？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_09",
      "hash64": "D1F1CD1ED872A1F0",
      "text": "没错，简约才是最强的。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_10",
      "hash64": "D1EE501ED86F97B2",
      "text": "对于平凡的我来说，\\n你实在是太刺激了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_11",
      "hash64": "D1EE511ED86F9965",
      "text": "……不过，我稍微明白一点了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_12",
      "hash64": "D1EE4E1ED86F944C",
      "text": "明白了为什么会让我在\\n担任四天王时使用飞行属性。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_13",
      "hash64": "D1EE4F1ED86F95FF",
      "text": "有些景色如果光是走在\\n平坦的道路上是注意不到的……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_14",
      "hash64": "D1EE4C1ED86F90E6",
      "text": "偶尔也需要仰望一下\\n像你这样能腾云驾雾的才能。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_15",
      "hash64": "D1EE4D1ED86F9299",
      "text": "我只是保证完成工作而已。\\n不是爱做才做的哦。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_020_normal_16",
      "hash64": "D1EE4A1ED86F8D80",
      "text": "今天是不加班的日子，\\n所以就此告辞了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
